<!--
    The "M" of the app's mark at the top of Home, as a filled shape: the letter M of Sora, the
    app's typeface, at weight 700. Its outline was read from res/font/sora.ttf (the letter's
    sixteen points, moved by the font's own weight axis to 700), so it is the same letter the
    mark on Home is written with. The font's licence is licenses/Sora-OFL.txt.

    It is as large on the icon as on the mark: there the letter is 15 sp on a 36 dp square, and
    a launcher shows the middle 72 of this 108 x 108 canvas, so one em is 30 here. The letter is
    24.2 wide and 21.9 high, in the middle, well inside the central 66 x 66 safe zone that every
    launcher shape leaves uncut.

    The dark is copied from the design system: the page colour (121316) in
    core/designsystem/theme/Color.kt, which is also the colour of the letter in the mark.
    Change both together. As the monochrome layer only the shape is used.
-->
